WEBVTT

00:11:57.956 --> 00:12:00.266
And the ALS patients,

00:12:00.266 --> 00:12:03.460
you know what their favorite
ones are, and their families'?

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:05.050
All of them.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:09.898
Because this misunderstood and 
underfunded "rare" disease,

00:12:09.898 --> 00:12:16.378
they just sat and watched people 
saying it over and over: "ALS, ALS."

00:12:16.378 --> 00:12:19.587
It was unbelievable.

00:12:19.587 --> 00:12:21.630
And those naysayers,

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.469
let's just talk a couple 
of stats, shall we?

00:12:24.469 --> 00:12:27.107
Okay, so the ALS Association,

00:12:27.107 --> 00:12:31.064
they think by year end,
it'll be 160 million dollars.